@dshfiles/agent-telemetry

This package is a TypeScript port of @loongsuite/dsh-plugin 0.1.3
(https://github.com/loongsuite/dsh-plugin, tag v0.1.3, commit
f44ccfcd2255186bfcfe1c9f8c7db047204865b7), Copyright 2026 LoongSuite
Contributors, and reproduces span names and attribute rules from
@loongsuite/otel-util-genai 0.1.1
(https://github.com/alibaba/loongsuite-js/tree/main/opentelemetry-util-genai),
Copyright The OpenTelemetry Authors. Both are licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0; the full text is in LICENSE.

Changes from the original, summarized in UPSTREAM.md:

- spans are recorded and exported through @dshfiles/dshx/tracing instead of
  the OpenTelemetry JS SDK, and no metrics are exported;
- tool bodies and model streams run with their span active, subagent turns join
  their parent's trace, and model calls with a purpose, compaction, approval
  and retry waits and background jobs get spans;
- span status messages carry an error type or code, never a message;
- the row is always loaded and records nothing until a trace destination
  exists.
